      "writtenOn": "2025-09-03T16:20:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Currently dumping the mutex history in the watchdog timeout works for me.  I do think preserving this can be useful. \n\nAs this is disabled by default, the intent is for a developer to enable this when a repeatable issue is observed, and log their mutex of interest.  Dump history when a potential deadlock may be occurring.",
